The first part of the text game "The Chronicles of Aarbron" is now available.
Visit http://www.geocities.com/EnchantedForest/8132 to download the first game.

"The Chronicles of Aarbron" is a MS DOS game, and should run on any 286 (or
better) with a minimum of 640k (you could probably run it with much less).

Source code is available on request.
